  - SpeakerName: Mina
    HasSpeakerSprite: 0
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 0}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 0
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 0}
    Text: Press R to summon Echo mina
  - SpeakerName: Mina
    HasSpeakerSprite: 0
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 0}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 0
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 0}
    Text: Stand on the presure plate while in Echo mina form. Wait fro the obstacle
      to be lifted
  - SpeakerName: Mina
    HasSpeakerSprite: 0
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 0}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 0
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 0}
    Text: Stand on the presure plate while in Echo mina form. Wait for the obstacle
      to be lifted
  - SpeakerName: Mina
    HasSpeakerSprite: 0
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 0}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 0
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 0}
    Text: Exist echo mina state by pressing R again
  - SpeakerName: Mina
